# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the root of the build output directory.
# scripts/build.mjs copies everything in public/ to that root on every build, so
# edit it here — a file dropped straight into output/ is deleted by the next run.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is the part that has to be read before it is
# changed. This page is one HTML document with an inline script, an inline
# module map and style attributes throughout, and dc-runtime evaluates the
# component with `new Function`. That is why 'unsafe-inline' and 'unsafe-eval'
# are there: a policy without them renders a blank page. What the policy is
# actually buying is the other four directives — no script may come from any
# host but ours, and connect-src/img-src are pinned to the short list of places
# the page is allowed to reach after the visitor asks it to. That list is the
# same promise the status line makes, enforced by the browser instead of by
# code review.
#
# Note: this blocks Cloudflare Web Analytics, whose beacon is injected at the
# edge from static.cloudflareinsights.com. That is deliberate — turn the feature
# off at the Pages project rather than widening script-src for it.
#
# Hosts, all of them behind a click except the first-party ones:
#   ipapi.co, ipwho.is          ~/visitor, the whois button
#   tile.openstreetmap.org      the map, drawn only after that button
#   github.com                  systemctl in the shell
#   mozolewski.eu, rysinder.*   the self-directed HEAD probes
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://tile.openstreetmap.org; connect-src 'self' https://ipapi.co https://ipwho.is https://github.com https://mozolewski.eu https://rysinder.mozolewski.eu
